    <bpmn:userTask id="P13_Activity_0nwm6rp" name="Record overdue letter">
      <bpmn:documentation>Record the overdue status and appointment date in the delay tracker. The tracker supports pathway monitoring and reporting.
External information flow P13_Flow_0vb3us2: send "delay record stored in the tracking system" to Track_Start_DelayRecord (Delay record received).</bpmn:documentation>
